WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.850
So the bad news will just not stop coming
for Donald Trump.

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:09.040
A bombshell New York Times article this week
yesterday, in fact, revealing that Donald

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:16.190
Trump has an undisclosed bank account in China
and it exposes a whole series of Chinese business

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:17.190
pursuits.

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:22.160
This is, of course, the same Donald Trump
that has been going after China for the virus

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:26.140
and going after China for doing this and that
unfair thing to the United States.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:30.630
The same Donald Trump that has been repeating
for months that if Joe Biden were to be president,

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.940
China would control Biden.

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:38.640
The same Trump whose Republican Party has
been going after Joe Biden's son, Hunter Biden,

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:45.219
for opening a bank account in China that Donald
Trump has a bank account in China and a long

00:00:45.219 --> 00:00:49.039
history of trying to do business with China.

00:00:49.039 --> 00:00:53.739
The New York Times has continued to analyze
the tax records that were the basis for the

00:00:53.739 --> 00:00:59.309
blockbuster story about trumping no federal
taxes in 10 of the last 15 years from a few

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:02.399
weeks ago, which feels like years ago, by
the way.

00:01:02.399 --> 00:01:04.340
That story was just a few weeks ago.

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:08.300
And The New York Times has now learned that
Donald Trump has bank accounts in Britain,

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:09.970
in Ireland and, yes, in China.

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:15.720
The Chinese bank account shocker was not on
Donald Trump's public financial disclosures

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:20.150
because it's held under a convenient corporate
name.

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:25.670
And that Chinese bank account paid one hundred
and eighty eight thousand dollars in taxes

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:29.010
to the Chinese government between 2013 and
2015.

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:34.070
Understand that that means Trump's business
paid more tax to the Chinese government in

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:38.170
those years than Trump paid in the United
States federally.

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:42.530
And Donald Trump is saying Biden has the China
problem.

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:45.950
And we know that Trump projects all the time.

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:49.380
Trump accuses others of being corrupt when
he's corrupt.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:53.700
Trump accuses others of nepotism when he's
the king of nepotism.

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:59.010
Trump accuses others of receiving softball
interviews when he gets weekly softball interviews

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:05.330
from Fox and Friends and Sean Hannity and
Maria Bartiromo and Eric Bolling yesterday

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:08.130
and the whole cast at Fox News.

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:14.859
But this is another level of projection, with
China claiming for weeks now that Hunter Biden

00:02:14.859 --> 00:02:17.909
has this and that financial connection to
China.

00:02:17.909 --> 00:02:20.719
And it's a problem for Joe Biden and so on.

00:02:20.719 --> 00:02:25.739
And all along, Donald Trump has had an undisclosed
Chinese bank account.

00:02:25.739 --> 00:02:32.049
And this puts a huge list of actions related
to China under the microscope once again.

00:02:32.049 --> 00:02:37.939
Many Chinese government proposals came after
Trump became president.

00:02:37.939 --> 00:02:43.790
Yvonne could trump one Chinese trademark approvals
for her.

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:50.130
Was it clothing or handbags after she joined
the White House staff?

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:51.970
And on and on and on.

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:55.760
And all of these now need to be scrutinized
under a new light.

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:58.579
Not that they didn't need to be scrutinized
before.

00:02:58.579 --> 00:03:06.529
It's a perfect amalgam of possible nepotism,
cronyism and corruption, which I don't think

00:03:06.529 --> 00:03:08.480
we will ever know the full scope of.

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:14.230
I know there's this idea that after Trump
leaves, whether it's in in, you know, a few

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:19.379
months or in four years, there will be investigations
and will eventually get to the bottom of it.

00:03:19.379 --> 00:03:20.879
I don't think we will.

00:03:20.879 --> 00:03:23.319
And let me just give you one more example.

00:03:23.319 --> 00:03:29.279
And again, each one of these examples could
be a huge story, a major investigation by

00:03:29.279 --> 00:03:30.279
itself.

00:03:30.279 --> 00:03:35.719
And I assure you, if this was a story about
Chelsea Clinton during a Hillary presidency

00:03:35.719 --> 00:03:39.459
instead of about Ivanka, it would be a huge
story.

00:03:39.459 --> 00:03:46.230
This from the same New York Times investigation
says, quote, Not long after winning the 2016

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:52.040
election, Mr. Trump reported selling a penthouse
in one of his Manhattan buildings for fifteen

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:58.409
point eight million dollars to a Chinese American
businesswoman named Shao Yan Chen, who bought

00:03:58.409 --> 00:04:04.419
the unit previously occupied by Ivonka Trump
and her husband, Jared Kushner, in an off

00:04:04.419 --> 00:04:05.799
market transaction.

00:04:05.799 --> 00:04:11.969
Ms Chen runs an international consulting firm
and reportedly has high level connections

00:04:11.969 --> 00:04:15.550
to government and political elites in China.

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:22.960
Circumstantially, that is as much of a red
flag or more ripe for investigation than anything

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:27.840
that we have about Hunter, Biden and Joe Biden
right now by itself.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:32.080
That sale could be a huge story to investigate.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:36.349
But again, we may never know the full scope
of what's gone down and what favors have been

00:04:36.349 --> 00:04:41.949
offered and done in exchange for what one
of you e-mailed me about this story saying.

00:04:41.949 --> 00:04:46.030
What is the breaking point for Trump supporters
and for Republicans with this stuff?

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:52.330
Republican congressmen all know Trump may
be tied to all of these different countries.

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:53.370
What's the breaking point?

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:56.880
The answer is we're 13 days away from the
election.

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:59.080
There is no breaking point if Trump wins.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.080
They.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:01.330
Win, in a sense.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:02.990
And they just try to maintain power.

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:07.199
If Trump loses, they start to distance themselves
from Trump.

00:05:07.199 --> 00:05:09.300
Pretend they never really supported him.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:12.160
He wasn't really a Republican and move on.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:17.370
And you could apply that prediction not just
to Republican elected officials, but just

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.470
your average run of the mill Trump supporter.

00:05:20.470 --> 00:06:55.229
And we will see what The New York Times has
in the next 13 days based on these documents.

